event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":78,"item_id":"rs_07ca6795fffada9a016acaac08a0108195a7cc39e6dc138f83","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Planning DatabaseSync Migration**\n\nI'm considering the tests needed for the migration using DatabaseSync. It seems essential to include an import step as part of that process. I wonder about the time I'll need; it looks like I have sufficient time to get everything prepared. I'll want to ensure that all necessary elements are accounted for in the testing phase. Organizing this will help make the migration smooth and successful!"}

